'''Gory''' (ゴリさん, ''Gori-san'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

