==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Gory
|Gory Dark
|Gory's first [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy variant. He has much more health, knockbacks and damage, and twice the movement speed.
|Gory Groom
|A bigger variant of Gory Dark. He has Base Destroyer and is one of the strongest Gory variants in terms of stats, but is also the slowest. First appears in [[The Forbidden Bride (Monthly Event)|The Forbidden Bride]].
|Angelic Gory
|Gory's [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant, with even more health, damage and speed than Gory Dark.
|Zory
|Gory's [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant. He has much more health and damage, and also less knockbacks. Can burrow under cats once, and revives with full health after being killed.
|General GreGory
|Gory's [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant. He has a weak [[Barrier]] with a breaking point of 6,000. He also has more knockbacks, health, damage and range.
|Gorilliam
|Gory Groom's [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant, with fewer knockbacks, higher health and range, and a high chance of warping cats back by 500. First appears in [[Forbidden Bride Pt II (Monthly Event)|Forbidden Bride Pt II]].
|Gary Gory
|An enemy from the [[Summer Break Cats|Summer Lesson]] event, he has moderate health and high damage, more range, faster attacks and faster movement than the original Gory. He also strengthens by 100% at 50% health.
|Shakurel Gory
|A variant of Gory from the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]]. Has double the health and attack power but isn't too difficult otherwise.
|MikuGory
|A variant of Gory from the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. Has much higher stats and a chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] cats.
|Ragin' Gory
|A Dark/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of Gory Dark, with more health, damage and range as well as immunity to freeze.
|Aku Gory
|Gory's [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant. Slower than Gory Dark or Angelic Gory, but has even higher DPS, fewer knockbacks, and a chance to perform a [[Savage Blow]] which deals triple damage.
|Angelic Beast Rajakong
|The toughest variant of Gory in terms of health, this Angel/Behemoth enemy's attacks have 50 piercing range and have a 10% chance to create a level 2 [[Wave Attack|Waves]]. He is also immune to Waves and [[Surge Attack|Surges]], but has a whopping 24 knockbacks.
|Demon Gory
|A variant of Gory from the [[Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba Collaboration Event]], with 3x as much HP and 3.75x attack power.
|Clyde Gory
|A variant of Gory from the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]. It has 4x health and 2.5x attack power, but moves slightly slower and has 1 less knockback than Gory.
}}

